Tested on Arista (broadcom) and confirmed this change fixed the regression described in https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/issues/22797
```
{
    "TUNNEL_DECAP_TABLE:IPINIP_TUNNEL" : {
        "tunnel_type":"IPINIP",
        "dscp_mode":"uniform",
        "ecn_mode":"copy_from_outer",
        "ttl_mode":"pipe"
    },
    "OP": "SET"
},
```
